                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>A conference of American Chiefs of Mission in Near Eastern countries was held at
                    Istanbul from November 26 to 29. The agreed conclusions (see <ref
                        target="#pg168">page 168</ref>) embodied a ninth item entitled “Current <pb
                        facs="1527" n="1511" xml:id="pg1511"/> Israeli-Jordan Peace Negotiations and
                    Annexation of Arab Palestine to Jordan.”</p>
            </div>
        </body>
